'getUserExchanges' is defined but never used.","'Carousel' is defined but never used.","'errorNotification' is defined but never used.","'loading' is assigned a value but never used.","React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'history' and 'user'. Either include them or remove the dependency array.",["535"],"'userSignin' is defined but never used.","'userSignUp' is defined but never used.",["536"],"'navItems' is assigned a value but never used.","'setNavItems' is assigned a value but never used.","'selectedCoin' is assigned a value but never used.","'setCoinCurrency' is assigned a value but never used.","'coinMVP' is assigned a value but never used.","'setCoinPVM' is assigned a value but never used.","'coinPresidencec' is assigned a value but never used.","'setCoinPresidence' is assigned a value but never used.","'data' is assigned a value but never used.","'demoExchange' is assigned a value but never used.","'startDate' is assigned a value but never used.","'executeTime' is assigned a value but never used.","'ruleName' is assigned a value but never used.","'coin' is assigned a value but never used.","'exchange' is assigned a value but never used.","'place' is assigned a value but never used.","'rating' is assigned a value but never used.","'price' is assigned a value but never used.","'time' is assigned a value but never used.","'min' is assigned a value but never used.","'date' is assigned a value but never used.","'amount' is assigned a value but never used.","'action' is assigned a value but never used.",["537"],"'ToastContainer' is defined but never used.","'user' is assigned a value but never used.","react/jsx-no-duplicate-props","No duplicate props allowed","JSXAttribute","noDuplicateProps",{"desc":"538","fix":"539"},{"desc":"538","fix":"540"},[6811,6830],"\"external noopener noreferrer\"",[7042,7061],"no-global-assign","no-unsafe-negation",{"desc":"541","fix":"542"},{"desc":"541","fix":"543"},{"desc":"541","fix":"544"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [dispatch, user]",{"range":"545","text":"546"},{"range":"547","text":"546"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [history, user]",{"range":"548","text":"549"},{"range":"550","text":"549"},{"range":"551","text":"549"},[1062,1068],"[dispatch, user]",[1163,1169],[1770,1772],"[history, user]",[965,967],[1141,1143]]